@startuml
title Adaptive concurrency: collector flow
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Register description with FuturesLimits;\nretain registration guard;
:Clone watch receiver; read allowance;
:Fill JoinSet while\ntasks + ordered buffer < allowance;
while (JoinSet contains tasks?) is (yes)
  :Wait for watch change OR task completion;
  if (Task completed?) then (yes)
    :Record indexed result and progress;
    if (Ordered collection?) then (yes)
      :Buffer result; move consecutive\ncompleted indices to outcomes;
    else (no)
      :Append result to outcomes;
    endif
  else (watch change)
    :Keep existing tasks running;
  endif
  :Read latest allowance;
  :If iterator not exhausted, fill JoinSet\nwhile tasks + ordered buffer < allowance;
  note right
    A larger allowance admits more work immediately.
    A smaller allowance lets existing work drain.
    No tasks are cancelled to enforce a decrease.
  end note
endwhile (no)
:Apply CollectionErrorPolicy\nto collected outcomes;
:Drop registration; rebalance\nremaining collectors;
:Return values or error;
stop
@enduml
